ARCHITECTURE.md
ENVIRONMENT.md
QUICK_START.md
TESTING_GUIDE.md
REFACTOR_SUMMARY.md
COMPLETION_SUMMARY.md

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
